{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/extras/7d9e72f4ca4a12b4471173e74fabfe66.avif?t=1771771763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/extras_big/7d9e72f4ca4a12b4471173e74fabfe66.avif?t=1771771763 width=800 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aliens have discovered how to portal travel! They ultimately want to take over the universe but there's just one problem... they're tiny!! Despite they're lack of physical prowess, these creatures wield very high intelligence stats and pilot robust vehicles.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/extras/16c880d415b81c003927022ee8def6fc.avif?t=1771771763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/extras_big/16c880d415b81c003927022ee8def6fc.avif?t=1771771763 width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Puzzled Towers is a first person tower defense where the player is able to build<i> just</i>\u00a0about anywhere. This is your planet, place towers in a way that will force aliens to take the longest and deadliest path possible. Aliens will continually update their built in GPS systems to try and outsmart you. Don't completely block their path or they'll completely jump over your towers!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><br>Currently there is one secret map. While the goal is to survive as long as possible, you can attempt to infiltrate the alien armies and find their home planet. Be warned! The farther up the portal system you go, the harder it gets.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><br>There is currently no save system and its singleplayer only.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/extras/7c0c8aa0dbd2ef236944c76a69430e08.avif?t=1771771763\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/extras_big/7c0c8aa0dbd2ef236944c76a69430e08.avif?t=1771771763 width=800 height=800 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2454740?t=1771771763","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2454740?t=1771771763","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2454740/093179cfe9e6dcf69a54b9044b349d0c35936568/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771771763","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a